able</small></div></article><article><span>⌂</span><div><b>Flexible Delivery</b><small>Pickup or home delivery</small></div></article></section><?php endif;?></main><footer class="store-footer">Healthcare Wellness Club • Customer Product Request Portal <span class="network-badge" data-network-status role="status" aria-live="polite">Online</span></footer><script src="<?=s24_h(s24_asset('store.js'))?>" defer></script><?php if(!$error):?><script>document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',()=>{const input=document.getElementById('detailQty');const qty=()=>Math.max(1,Math.min(20,Number(input.value)||1));document.querySelector('[data-qty-minus]').addEventListener('click',()=>input.value=String(Math.max(1,qty()-1)));document.querySelector('[data-qty-plus]').addEventListener('click',()=>input.value=String(Math.min(20,qty()+1)));document.querySelector('[data-detail-add]').addEventListener('click',event=>{input.value=String(qty());hwcAdd(<?=(int)$product['id']?>,qty());event.currentTarget.textContent='Added ✓';hwcAnnounce('Product added to cart.');setTimeout(()=>event.currentTarget.textContent='Add to Cart',900)});document.querySelector('[data-detail-buy]').addEventListener('click',()=>{hwcSet(<?=(int)$product['id']?>,qty());location.href='cart.php'})});</script><?php endif;?>
